Z||000004||WhiteFieroBlur||06-16-2000||12:34 PM||||Well where is my graduation? I have my cap and gown ready  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> I have been a memeber since 05-20-2000, and I have 27 posts so far. I really love using this forum, I check it all thru out my day for new posts to read. It has so much usfull info on my car, its like a little kid being in a candy store. I didn't really want the Fiero GT when I saw it at first, but I am glad I got it cause having it has been pretty frustrating but alot of fun. I wouldn't trade it for any mustang or camaro or anything. I know my GT is gonna look so good once I get it all fixed up. ||||reg||14
